---
import { business } from '../data/business';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import ContactLink from './ContactLink.astro';
---
<section class="section contact-section" id="section-contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">NOS ENCONTRAMOS ACÁ</span><h2 id="contact-title">Pasá por la librería.<br /><em>Te esperamos.</em></h2></div><p>Una consulta, un material que falta, una nueva idea. Estamos para ayudarte.</p></div>
    <div class="contact-layout">
      <div class="contact-details">
        <div class="contact-row"><Icon name="pin" /><div><h3>En el centro de Avellaneda</h3><address>{business.address}, {business.premises.toLowerCase()}<br />{business.city}</address><a class="text-link" href={business.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-contact="directions" data-location="contact">Cómo llegar <Icon name="diagonal" size={16} /></a></div></div>
        <div class="contact-row"><Icon name="clock" /><div><h3>Nuestros horarios</h3><dl class="hours"><div><dt>Lunes a viernes</dt><dd>10 a 18 h</dd></div><div><dt>Sábados</dt><dd>10 a 13 h</dd></div></dl><small>Por feriados, consultanos antes de venir.</small></div></div>
        <div class="contact-row"><Icon name="phone" /><div><h3>Hablemos</h3><p><a href={`tel:${business.phone}`} data-contact="phone" data-location="contact">{business.phoneDisplay}</a><br /><a href={`mailto:${business.email}`} data-contact="email" data-location="contact">{business.email}</a></p></div></div>
        <ContactLink location="contact" />
      </div>
      <div class="location-panel">
        <div class="location-caption"><span class="eyebrow">LIBRERÍA 2001</span><h3>Av. Mitre 634</h3><p>Buscanos en los locales 7 y 10.</p><div class="location-actions"><a class="text-link" href={business.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-contact="directions" data-location="map">Abrir indicaciones <Icon name="diagonal" size={16} /></a></div></div>
        <div class="map-embed"><iframe title="Ubicación de Librería 2001 en Av. Mitre 634, Avellaneda" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=-34.661290%2C-58.366276&amp;z=14&amp;output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
